<title>FINLAND: RAUTARUUKKI TO SELL ITS METALCOLOUR.</title>
<headline>RAUTARUUKKI TO SELL ITS METALCOLOUR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-controlled group Rautaruukki Oy said on Thursday it will sell its Metalcolour A/S unit to Danish investment company AT Holding AsP.</p>
<p>&quot;Rautaruukki Strip Products will sell its entire stake in steel strips coating company Metalcolour A/S to Danish investment company AT Holding Asp,&quot; Rautaruukki said in a statement.</p>
<p>Rautaruukki said Metalcolour will be divested because its product range does not fit in with Rautaruukki's plastic coating production.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
